      "id": "claim_0bfa95c93b024a439bce0fd15a02421e",
      "statement": "`ResearchLoopAgent.run()` creates and persists a running loop record before iterating; each completed pass recalls memory, persists an iteration, updates metric and cost state, stores memory/graph evidence, checks stopping conditions, finalizes the loop record, and best-effort generates a report returned through `LoopResult`.",
